                    },
                    {
                      "_type": "Return",
                      "_fields": {
                        "value": {
                          "_type": "JoinedStr",
                          "_fields": {
                            "values": [
                              {
                                "_type": "Constant",
                                "_fields": {
                                  "value": "You are a hyper-efficient HR intelligence analyst. Your task is to perform a differential analysis between a job description (JD) and a candidate's master resume. Extract key entities and identify the signal gap and overlap.\n\n**JOB DESCRIPTION:**\n---\n",
                                  "kind": "None"
                                },
                                "_lineno": 2966,
                                "_col_offset": 19
                              },
                              {
                                "_type": "FormattedValue",
                                "_fields": {
                                  "value": {
                                    "_type": "Subscript",
                                    "_fields": {
                                      "value": {
                                        "_type": "Name",
                                        "_fields": {
                                          "id": "job_description",
                                          "ctx": {
                                            "_type": "Load",
                                            "_fields": {}
                                          }
                                        },
                                        "_lineno": 2970,
                                        "_col_offset": 1
                                      },
                                      "slice": {
                                        "_type": "Slice",
                                        "_fields": {
                                          "lower": "None",
                                          "upper": {
                                            "_type": "Constant",
                                            "_fields": {
                                              "value": "2500",
                                              "kind": "None"
                                            },
                                            "_lineno": 2970,
                                            "_col_offset": 18
                                          },
                                          "step": "None"
                                        },
                                        "_lineno": 2970,
                                        "_col_offset": 17
                                      },
                                      "ctx": {
                                        "_type": "Load",
                                        "_fields": {}
                                      }
                                    },
                                    "_lineno": 2970,
                                    "_col_offset": 1
                                  },
                                  "conversion": "-1",
                                  "format_spec": "None"
                                },
                                "_lineno": 2970,
                                "_col_offset": 0
                              },
                              {
                                "_type": "Constant",
                                "_fields": {
                                  "value": "\n---\n\n**CANDIDATE MASTER RESUME (Experience Section):**\n---\n",
                                  "kind": "None"
                                },
                                "_lineno": 2970,
                                "_col_offset": 24
                              },
                              {
                                "_type": "FormattedValue",
                                "_fields": {
                                  "value": {
                                    "_type": "Subscript",
                                    "_fields": {
                                      "value": {
                                        "_type": "Name",
                                        "_fields": {
                                          "id": "resume_text",
                                          "ctx": {
                                            "_type": "Load",
                                            "_fields": {}
                                          }
                                        },
                                        "_lineno": 2975,
                                        "_col_offset": 1
                                      },
                                      "slice": {
                                        "_type": "Slice",
                                        "_fields": {
                                          "lower": "None",
                                          "upper": {
                                            "_type": "Constant",
                                            "_fields": {
                                              "value": "2500",
                                              "kind": "None"
                                            },
                                            "_lineno": 2975,
                                            "_col_offset": 14
                                          },
                                          "step": "None"
                                        },
                                        "_lineno": 2975,
                                        "_col_offset": 13
                                      },
                                      "ctx": {
                                        "_type": "Load",
                                        "_fields": {}
                                      }
                                    },
                                    "_lineno": 2975,
                                    "_col_offset": 1
                                  },
                                  "conversion": "-1",
                                  "format_spec": "None"
                                },
                                "_lineno": 2975,
                                "_col_offset": 0
                              },
                              {
                                "_type": "Constant",
                                "_fields": {
                                  "value": "\n---\n\n**TASK:**\nAnalyze both texts and return a single, valid JSON object with the following structure.\n1.  **Extract entities from the JD:**\n    - `target_company_name`: The name of the hiring company.\n    - `precise_role_title`: The exact job title.\n    - `key_technologies`: Top 5-7 specific technologies, frameworks, or platforms mentioned (e.g., \"Agentic platform\", \"GenAI engineering\", \"AWS Bedrock\").\n    - `core_responsibilities`: Top 3-5 core duties or focus areas (e.g., \"post-sales adoption\", \"customer retention\", \"strategic partnerships\").\n2.  **Extract entities from the Resume:**\n    - `candidate_skills`: Top 10-15 skills and technologies the candidate emphasizes.\n3.  **Perform Differential Analysis:**\n    - `signal_gap_keywords`: Keywords from `key_technologies` that are **MISSING** from `candidate_skills`. This is the most important output.\n    - `signal_overlap_keywords`: Keywords that appear in **BOTH** `key_technologies` and `candidate_skills`.\n\n**OUTPUT FORMAT (JSON ONLY):**\n```json\n{\n  \"jd_entities\": {\n    \"target_company_name\": \"<string>\",\n    \"precise_role_title\": \"<string>\",\n    \"key_technologies\": [\"<string>\", ...],\n    \"core_responsibilities\": [\"<string>\", ...]\n  },\n  \"resume_entities\": {\n    \"candidate_skills\": [\"<string>\", ...]\n  },\n  \"differential_analysis\": {\n    \"signal_gap_keywords\": [\"<string>\", ...],\n    \"signal_overlap_keywords\": [\"<string>\", ...]\n  }\n}\n```\n\nCRITICAL: Return only the JSON object. Do not include any preamble, explanation, or markdown formatting outside of the JSON block.\n",
                                  "kind": "None"
                                },
                                "_lineno": 2975,
                                "_col_offset": 20
                              }
                            ]
                          },
                          "_lineno": 2966,
                          "_col_offset": 15
                        }
                      },
                      "_lineno": 2966,
                      "_col_offset": 8
                    }
