                      "value": "\n    HOP-3: Generate resume content using Gemini API.\n    v11.0 REDESIGN: This class is now architected to consume the *full*\n    ThematicAnalysis object from HOP-0, including Secondary Themes\n    and Authenticity Patterns, in all relevant generation prompts.\n    ",
