                      },
                      "_lineno": 10110,
                      "_col_offset": 4
                    }
                  ],
                  "value": {
                    "_type": "Constant",
                    "_fields": {
                      "value": "\n    As the Vice President of AI Technical Success at DataRobot, you will lead a world-class team of customer-facing data scientists and AI engineers.\n    Your primary mission is to ensure our customers achieve maximum value from our AI platform, driving adoption, retention, and expansion.\n    You will be responsible for scaling the technical success function, developing best practices for GenAI and LLM implementation, and serving as a trusted advisor to our most strategic enterprise clients.\n    This is a post-sales leadership role that requires a deep understanding of enterprise AI/ML deployment, customer relationship management, and strategic thinking.\n    You will partner closely with Sales, Product, and Engineering to champion the voice of the customer and influence the product roadmap.\n    Key responsibilities include P&L management for the professional services team, building strategic partnerships with cloud providers, and ensuring the successful delivery of AI solutions.\n    ",
                      "kind": "None"
                    },
                    "_lineno": 10110,
                    "_col_offset": 25
                  },
                  "type_comment": "None"
                },
                "_lineno": 10110,
                "_col_offset": 4
